  "head": "6b444eba4573092b57919ee3e497d86d2ebb3ece",
  "objective": "Remove repeated raid/party roster work during joins and leaves. The thread goal also includes cursor enter/leave with a carried action.",
  "changes": [
    "The existing deferred raid roster handler now dispatches optional healer adjunct work after prepared unit reconciliation.",
    "Missing-buff refreshes share the raid unit paint queue and are covered by pending full or aura paint. A scheduled friendly target paint already includes its optional pass.",
    "With optional features disabled, the roster dispatch skips scanning frames and creates no second timer. Pet/target recovery and native visibility are retained."
  ],
